<p>I don't feel like this is a dystopia. I also don't really buy the wormhole stuff. Also, it gets a little unnecessarily hard to follow.</p>
<p>However, it's a pretty strong story overall, and I enjoyed it. +1. And I fixed a number of grammar errors.</p>

